flowchart TD
  U[Analyst opens research workspace] --> Q[Select decision question]
  Q --> L[Choose one evidence lane]
  L --> G{Source and schema gates pass?}
  G -->|No| B[Show blocked reason and correction path]
  B --> L
  G -->|Yes| X[Inspect quality and preparation]
  X --> A[Open aggregate result and denominator]
  A --> E[Open Evidence Passport]
  E --> R{Does conclusion survive predeclared scenarios?}
  R -->|Yes, reviewed| P[Prioritize a bounded pilot]
  R -->|Mapping uncertain| M[Review phrase or concept mapping]
  R -->|Weak, missing, unstable| C[Collect evidence or defer]
  S[SDS aggregate result] -. blocked by policy .-> P
